dsh-pi-tui
==========

This product renders through `@earendil-works/pi-tui` (MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner), used as a dependency.

The following implementation patterns were adapted from the pi coding-agent
interactive mode (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi, MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner) and retain that copyright:

- `src/ui/views.ts` — streaming assistant-markdown rendering, collapsed
  reasoning blocks, and compact tool-execution cards (adapted from
  `packages/coding-agent/src/modes/interactive/components/assistant-message.ts`
  and `components/tool-execution.ts`).
- `src/ui/session-picker.ts` / `src/ui/overlays.ts` — overlay content must be
  a single input-forwarding component (the `ModelSelectorComponent` pattern
  from `packages/coding-agent/src/modes/interactive/components/model-selector.ts`).
- `src/core/model.ts` — the event → render-model fold mirrors the channel
  state machine of the same interactive mode.

- `src/ui/views.ts` — the colored unified-diff rendering adapts
  `renderDiff` from
  `packages/coding-agent/src/modes/interactive/components/diff.ts`.

